<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 235-5 INNINGS CLOSED V DUKE OF NORFOLK'S XI.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 235-5 INNINGS CLOSED V DUKE OF NORFOLK'S XI.</headline>
<dateline>ARUNDEL, England 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia scored 235 for five in 50 overs in their opening one-day tour match against the Duke of Norfolk's XI on Thursday.</p>
</text>
